1
00:00:00,075 --> 00:00:02,957
Orangutan ternyata pernah
dianggap bisa bicara...

2
00:00:02,957 --> 00:00:04,590
tapi sengaja diam,

3
00:00:04,590 --> 00:00:06,203
supaya tidak disuruh kerja!

4
00:00:06,203 --> 00:00:08,386
Dokter Belanda di Batavia mencatatnya...

5
00:00:08,386 --> 00:00:11,493
Linnaeus memasukkannya
ke golongan manusia!

6
00:00:11,493 --> 00:00:13,769
benarkah orangutan bisa "bicara"?

7
00:00:13,769 --> 00:00:14,944
Di hutan Sumatra,

8
00:00:14,944 --> 00:00:16,931
peneliti menyamar jadi harimau.

9
00:00:16,931 --> 00:00:19,944
Seekor induk diam sampai 20 menit...

10
00:00:19,944 --> 00:00:20,756
baru berteriak,

11
00:00:20,756 --> 00:00:22,360
seolah memberi tahu anaknya!

12
00:00:22,360 --> 00:00:25,420
Kemampuan yang dulu
dikira cuma milik manusia:

13
00:00:25,420 --> 00:00:27,006
"membicarakan" masa lalu!

14
00:00:27,006 --> 00:00:27,603
Follow,

15
00:00:27,603 --> 00:00:29,968
besok ada yang lebih aneh.
